tests/cli_surface.rs (goldens feature), hermetic: walks `path --help`
recursively and snapshots every command's help (23 group snapshots,
99 commands); diffs site/pages/cli.md's command tree against the
binary (45 undocumented commands, 31 undocumented flags on 10
documented commands, nothing documented-but-missing); and runs each
documented workflow and plumbing command over the examples and the
golden sessions (kind, auth status, validate, query ancestors and the
dead-end query, merge, render dot, the track workflow end to end,
import git single and multi-branch, list/derive/import/show for
claude/codex/copilot/pi, every CLI writer, cache ls/rm).

Findings, recorded as qualifier concerns on site/pages/cli.md: the
page's tree omits most commands (incl. p cache sync); --force and
--no-cache are not global; the track example's /tmp/session.json is
never created (track init prints its own .path.jsonl path); p validate
accepts a dangling parent; JSON key order is not deterministic across
runs (snapshots canonicalise JSON).
