+  render    Render Toolpath documents to other formats
+  merge     Merge multiple Toolpath documents into a single Graph
+  validate  Validate a Toolpath document
+  derive    Derive a Toolpath document from a source and stream it to stdout (the stdout-only sibling of `import`; equivalent to `import … --no-cache`)
