+  kind     List bundled document kinds, or print a kind's schema (the field reference for `path query`)
+  auth     Manage Pathbase credentials for trace uploads
+  config   Edit the user configuration (~/.toolpath/config.toml)
+  p        Plumbing: lower-level operations on documents and sources (import, export, cache, list, render, merge, validate, derive, project, incept, track, query)
+  goldens  Capture, check and diff hermetic goldens for cross-harness transformations
+  haiku    Print a random Toolpath haiku
+  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
